<title>SWEDEN: Ericsson wins 830 mln skr Japan order.</title>
<headline>Ericsson wins 830 mln skr Japan order.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish telecommunications group LM Ericsson AB said on Wednesday it won an order worth 830 million crowns from Central Japan Digital Phone (CDP) for an expansion and upgrade of a mobile telephone network.  </p>
<p>The expansion and upgrade of the Japanese company's Pacific Digital Cellular (PDC) network will be done in 1997, Ericsson said in a statement.</p>
<p>CDP is one of the three telephone operators constituting Digital Phone Group (DPG), which has received a license to operate a PDC network, Ericsson said.</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700 1006</p>
</text>
